1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
I don’t know what happened to my sister.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
“Of course I’ll go with you,” she said.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Wait… did you hear that?

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
We met at a café near the station – it was raining.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,500
You can’t just walk away like that.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,500
Do you remember when we were kids?

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,500
This changes everything — everything.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Are you sure it was him?

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,500
I’m sorry, I didn’t mean to hurt you.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Stay with me a little longer.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Nobody told me the truth, did they?

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,500
Everyone knows you’re leaving tomorrow morning.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,500
Take off your shoes before you come in.

14
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Where’s my yellow coat?

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,500
Let’s do this quickly, before someone sees us.

